  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: bf2d7532251303545ab78ab68b00d5cf, type: 3}
  m_Name: 17F02_TerminalSignoff_B
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sequenceId: 17F02_TerminalSignoff_B
  notes: '17F02 option B sign-off and 17F03 alert. Source: HEARTH_Full_Game_Script_Expanded_Native_English_Lobby_Mia_Commentary.md,
    stable marker 17F02_TerminalSignoff_B. Text is synchronized by Tools/Hearth/Dialogue/Sync
    All Dialogue From Final Script.'
  lines:
  - startDelay: 0.15
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Keep it off?
    holdSeconds: 2.2820754
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: It is in the manual. I have never seen it selected.
    holdSeconds: 5.3009434
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: You're giving Ben and Claire a chance to face the issue without mediation.
      Understood. You're looking beyond the standard protocol.
    holdSeconds: 8.697169
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: I need to note the risk. The household alarm will remain active throughout
      the observation period, and company monitoring will continue.
    holdSeconds: 9.074528
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: If Ben and Claire separate, this disposition may be referred for post-incident
      review. You should be prepared to explain it.
    holdSeconds: 8.697169
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: The option is allowed. You selected it, and I have filed it.
    holdSeconds: 5.678302
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: For the next household, Inspector, let's keep things steady.
    holdSeconds: 4.5462265
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Next, proceed to 17F-03 for the final inspection on tonight's route.
    holdSeconds: 5.3009434
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Inspector, 17F-03 went offline ten minutes ago. My restart signal is receiving
      no response, and I cannot read the household from the corridor. You will need
      to enter.
    holdSeconds: 11.716038
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  postSequenceDelay: 0.18
